{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure the sum of the distances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4ce9a7a0c12f6c25c3e45ee1fec44f1d4c3039a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(13,0)--(13,4)--(10,4)); draw((12.5,0)--(12.5,.5)--(13,.5)); draw((13,3.5)--(12.5,3.5)--(12.5,4)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), S); label(&quot;B&quot;, (13,0), SE); label(&quot;C&quot;, (13,4), NE); label(&quot;D&quot;, (10,4), N); label(&quot;13&quot;, (6.5,0), S); label(&quot;4&quot;, (13,2), E); label(&quot;3&quot;, (11.5,4), N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"115\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3724136cddab43a6223f3a89be57e4e743d461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{between 10 and 11} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{between 15 and 16}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{between 16 and 17}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"457\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Pythagoras' Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55cfdc04174eac78e7eeca4e0ef3580b4539a99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = \\sqrt{3^2 + 4^2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90dd34c837cb1e89170f91cbbe2f1f01d981bf33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = \\sqrt{(13 - 3)^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"248\" height=\"32\" />. Thus the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/081d09e641b1ffab08ddac773502df3257ba91a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + \\sqrt{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />, and as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/d/0ad12777e5feff2f70f074d7a79036c3c8e8d6eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 &lt; 116 &lt; 121$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"129\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/053c74dda4af4272a35b35f9fbdac2fb23e82568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 &lt; \\sqrt{116} &lt; 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />, so that the sum is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f12a295a8e3aaf0ae5643fc975c34187a68004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/84876f68eac589828f17aada22fa5478ee6da9ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b317654f901a9c8f56585721a617396d3b050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti